around a new trap, while a voice in the speakers comments, mocks you and keeps count of your mistakes. Other captives cross your path: who you trust changes the ending. No jumpscares, just psychological horror. What to try during the fes","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:32:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044083","verified_at":"2026-10-26T15:16:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922750-1847286114030922","game_id":"steam-4922750","kind":"announcement","title":"Survivors' Tournament: the results","summary":"The Steam Next Fest Survivors' Tournament is over. Thank you to everyone who played, streamed or just watched: for 48 hours, the demo's leaderboards never stood still. The winners Survival (solo): ChocoX7, wave 30 and 599 robots destroyed Labyrinth: ChocoX7, level 3 in 7:47 Evacuation (Normal): Leo86Lars, 0:40 THE GRINDER, the unseen course: Smashizard, 0:56 Survival for two: Corcho, wave 10 Each winner will receive a Steam key for the full game at release (one key for ChocoX7's double win). Cor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:21:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030922","verified_at":"2026-10-22T06:24:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922750-1846651706693078","game_id":"steam-4922750","kind":"announcement","title":"Live on the store page: We Don't Exist at Steam Next Fest","summary":"Every door leads back into the same white cube, rebuilt around a new trap, while a voice on the speakers grades your mistakes. During Steam Next Fest, we're showing gameplay from the free demo right here on the store page. Like what you see? Download the demo from this page, and add We Don't Exist to your wishlist: it's the best way to support a solo dev during the festival. The Survivors' Tournament runs in the demo until Wednesday, October 21 at 7 pm Paris time (17:00 UTC), in the EVENTS tab.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T23:27:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693078","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922750-1846651706692323","game_id":"steam-4922750","kind":"announcement","title":"The Survivors' Tournament is now open!","summary":"The Survivors' Tournament has begun! Until Wednesday, October 21 at 7 pm Paris time (17:00 UTC), launch the free We Don't Exist demo, open the EVENTS tab in the main menu and step into the trials. Five events: Survival, Survival for two, Labyrinth, Evacuation and the brand-new track THE GRINDER, revealed tonight. The best player in each event wins a key for the full game. Open to everyone, for free: streamers and viewers share the same leaderboards. Remember to record your run: every winning sco","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:07:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692323","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922750-1846651706692061","game_id":"steam-4922750","kind":"announcement","title":"The Survivors' Tournament is open, right in the middle of Steam Next Fest","summary":"\"Evaluation session now open. All subjects are expected.\" We Don't Exist at Steam Next Fest The free We Don't Exist demo is part of Steam Next Fest October. Throughout the festival it's waiting for you: the awakening, the trapped rooms, the infirmary, a first day in the colony, and every training mode. The tournament is open From Monday, October 19 at 7 pm to Wednesday, October 21 at 7 pm (Paris time), in the EVENTS tab of the demo's menu. Survival solo, and two-player Survival Labyrinth Evacuat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:09:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922750-1845383656395506","game_id":"steam-4922750","kind":"announcement","title":"Survivors' Tournament: 48 hours in the demo, one key per trial","summary":"Survivors' Tournament, Steam Next Fest From Monday, October 19 at 7 pm to Wednesday, October 21 at 7 pm (Paris time), right inside the free We Don't Exist demo, in the EVENTS tab of the menu. Only results set during those 48 hours count. Everyone can take part, for free. Streamers and viewers share the same leaderboards. One Steam account per player. Five trials, one full-game key each Survival (solo): highest wave reached; on a tie, most robots destroyed. Two-player Survival: highest wave, then","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T07:29:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395506","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922750-1845383656395417","game_id":"steam-4922750","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: new modes, online leaderboards and a tournament","summary":"\"The evaluation protocol has been extended. Subjects are asked to comply.\" A new look for the demo The big October update is live, free, right inside the demo: New game modes, and online leaderboards to measure yourself against the other subjects. 9 new Steam achievements. The game is now available in 17 languages. A new EVENTS tab in the main menu. The Survivors' Tournament For the opening of Steam Next Fest, the demo hosts a tournament: from Monday, October 19 at 8 pm to Wednesday, October 21 ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T06:51:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395417","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922750-1841579228678735","game_id":"steam-4922750","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you. More than a thousand of you came inside.","summary":"\"The facility received more people than expected.\" Thank you The demo has passed one thousand downloads. For a one person studio, that is not just another number: it is a thousand doors pushed open, and far more than we hoped for when we released it. Your feedback did the work We received a lot of it, through the Contact us button in the menu, through the discussions on this page, and from those who took the time to record their visit. Almost everything below comes from there. Keep it coming: it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T15:58:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678735","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4922750-1840944183777867","game_id":"steam-4922750","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you, visitors. An achievement awaits the survivors.","summary":"\"New survivors in the facility...\" Thank you A huge thank you to everyone who pushed the facility's doors since the demo came out. Far more of you stepped inside than we expected, and your feedback is already shaping the game, day after day. The first achievement is live End of the Tour is reserved for those who survive to the end of the demo. Already finished it? You will have to go back inside to claim it. What changed inside Blood: